---
import H2 from "@/components/ui/h2.astro";
import FancyItalic from "./fancy-italic.astro";
---

<div class="space-y-6 px-0 py-10 lg:px-30">
  <H2 class="text-shadow-foreground/5 text-shadow-lg">interests and hobbies</H2>
  <p class="text-pretty">
    <span>I <FancyItalic>listen to</FancyItalic> Gojira, Parcels, and Angine de Poitrine, </span>
    <span><FancyItalic>read</FancyItalic> Asimov, Rollo May, and Slavoj Žižek, </span>
    <span><FancyItalic>play</FancyItalic> Hades, Disco Elysium, and Baldur's Gate 3, </span>
    <span><FancyItalic>think</FancyItalic> about privacy, open source, and tech, </span>
    <span>
      I like to <FancyItalic>ride</FancyItalic> my bicycle, <FancyItalic>take</FancyItalic> some cat photos,
      <FancyItalic> play</FancyItalic> my electric guitar, and <FancyItalic>run</FancyItalic> everything
      on Linux.
    </span>
  </p>
</div>
